    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like my core self is intact. it feels like i burnt everything down. i thought being a good person mattered, but the world doesn't care about truth. it just cares about who's left standing. i'm just exhausted from trying to fight a system that's designed to crush anyone who isn't corrupt. what's even the point in trying to \"navigate\" anymore? the hole is just too deep.",
