      "content": "counselors and advocates... they're just part of the same system that chewed me up and spat me out. they talk about \"rebuilding\" like there's actually anything left to build with. i have no career, no reputation, no community. i'm just a ghost in a room. honestly, it feels like the most honest thing i could do is just accept that i'm finished. like, why is everyone so obsessed with making people keep struggling when there's no light at the end of it?",
